displaymanager (0.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
    - GTK 4 / libadwaita UI and CLI for Dell monitors over DDC/CI.
    - Input selection, Picture-by-Picture, side swap, right-side input.
    - KVM (USB hub) switching with state detection via USB.
    - Optional GNOME custom keyboard shortcuts.
    - Original GPL-3+ application icon.

